Description: page thumbnails in the page list, localisation fixes
 The left-hand page list showed only the page number. Render a small
 thumbnail of every page in a background thread (PageThumbnailRenderer)
 and draw it above the page label (PageThumbnailItem).
 .
 Open with the page list instead of the bookmarks by default.
 .
 Reload the catalog by signature at start-up and when the language is
 changed in the Locale preferences (B_LOCALE_CHANGED), rebuilding the
 menu bar and tool bar of the open windows; the automatic catalog lookup
 of B_TRANSLATE leaves every string in English on V\OS.
 .
 Complete the Italian catalog, which only had 6 of 253 strings translated.
Author: Angelo Scarna <calang83@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/kratos83/VOS-bepdf

